<title>ESTONIA: FINEST TO OPEN NEW ST BARBARA HOTEL.</title>
<headline>FINEST TO OPEN NEW ST BARBARA HOTEL.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hotel group Finest said on Wednesday that it will open its new central Tallinn hotel, the St Barbara Hotel, in June.</p>
<p>&quot;When the St Barbara Hotel begins operations, it will be part of the oldest and only Estonian hotel chain,&quot; Finest said in a statement.</p>
<p>The group plans a news conference on May 29 to mark the opening of the hotel.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
